Included here:
- apps/openbot-computer — Playwright Chromium computer (/workspace, browser, take-the-wheel)
- apps/openbot-bot — AG-UI Bot (models answered by the OpenDoor gateway)
- apps/openbot-supervisor — per-Bot container supervisor (Docker socket, four verbs)
- apps/dashboard/src/components/openbot — coworker computer UI (screen, take-the-wheel)
- packages/shared/src/openbot-schema.ts
- packages/shared/src/openbot-target.ts

Not included: CopilotKit Intelligence (separate license), the OpenBot Vite app,
Better Auth, or SPIRE. gVisor (`COMPUTER_RUNTIME=runsc`) is optional on the host.
